<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Every word the app shows, in English, the source language.

    Translations live in values-<qualifier>/strings.xml with the same names.
    A name missing there shows this English text, never a blank.

    Notes for translators:
    - Keep every placeholder (%1$s, %1$d) and its number. The order inside the
      sentence can change.
    - "·" separates two short facts on one line. Keep it.
    - Brand names stay as they are: CashPilot, Android, GitHub, Tailscale, and
      the app names (EarnApp, Grass...).
    - "Fleet" and "Reveal API Key" name the server dashboard's own page and
      button: use the words the CashPilot web UI uses in your language.
    - https://, http://, 192.168.x.x, 10.x.x.x, .local and .lan stay as written.
-->
